1. Booking Options
Customers can book airport transfers, hotel accommodation, or combined services directly through our website without requesting a quotation.
Customers may also request a booking or quotation through email or WhatsApp.
Customers must provide accurate information, including travel dates, pickup and destination details, passenger information, and any other details required for their selected service.
A booking is confirmed once GQ Travel & Hotels has accepted the booking details and issued confirmation.
2. Payment Methods
Customers can pay using the payment methods available for their selected service, including:
•	Online Mobile Money (MoMo), where supported.
•	MTN Mobile Money, where available.
•	Telecel Cash, where available and supported.
•	Other payment methods offered or confirmed by GQ Travel & Hotels.
Customers must follow the payment instructions provided and keep their payment receipt or transaction confirmation.
3. Cancellation and Refund Policy for Direct Online Bookings
The following cancellation conditions apply to direct online bookings, subject to any specific conditions disclosed for the selected service and applicable law.
A. Cancellation within 24 hours of booking confirmation
Customers may cancel free of charge within 24 hours after receiving booking confirmation, provided the booked service has not started.
B. Cancellation 14 or more calendar days before the scheduled service
Customers may cancel free of charge and receive a full refund of the amount paid.
C. Cancellation 7–13 calendar days before the scheduled service
A fixed cancellation fee of GH₵1,500 will be deducted from the total amount paid. The remaining balance will be refunded.
Example: If the customer paid GH₵3,000, GH₵1,500 will be retained as the cancellation fee, and GH₵1,500 will be refunded.
D. Cancellation fewer than 7 calendar days before the scheduled service
The full booking amount is non-refundable, except where the 24-hour free cancellation rule or applicable law provides otherwise.
Cancellation periods are calculated using calendar days before the scheduled service date.
4. Hotel-Specific Cancellation Conditions
Hotel bookings may be subject to individual hotel cancellation policies, including different cancellation deadlines, fees, or non-refundable conditions.
Any hotel-specific conditions will be clearly communicated or displayed before the customer completes the booking and payment. Where the hotel's conditions differ from the general cancellation policy, the applicable terms will be identified before the customer commits to the booking.
5. Combined Hotel and Airport Transfer Bookings
For bookings that include both hotel accommodation and airport transfers, the cancellation conditions for each service will be disclosed separately before payment.
Cancelling one service does not automatically cancel the other. Any applicable cancellation fees and refunds will be determined according to the conditions disclosed for each service.
6. Bookings by Email or WhatsApp
Customers may request a quotation or booking through email or WhatsApp.
Before payment, GQ Travel & Hotels will provide the applicable service details, price, payment instructions, cancellation fees, and refund conditions in writing through the quotation, contract, or booking documentation.
Customers must review and confirm their acceptance of these conditions before making payment.
The written conditions provided for the booking will form part of the booking agreement, subject to applicable law.
7. How to Cancel
All cancellation requests must be submitted in writing through the contact details provided in the booking confirmation.
GQ Travel & Hotels will confirm receipt of the cancellation request and explain any applicable cancellation fee and refund amount.
Refunds will be processed using the original payment method where reasonably possible, or another agreed method, subject to applicable law.
8. Mandatory Acceptance of Terms & Conditions
These Terms & Conditions apply to bookings made directly through the GQ Travel & Hotels website and to bookings arranged through email or WhatsApp.
Direct online bookings: Customers must read and actively accept these Terms & Conditions before completing their booking. The acceptance checkbox must be unticked by default, and customers must select it before submitting their booking or proceeding to payment.
If a customer does not agree to these Terms & Conditions, they must not proceed with or complete the booking or payment.
Email and WhatsApp bookings: Customers will receive the applicable conditions in writing before payment and must confirm their acceptance before proceeding.
By accepting the applicable terms, customers acknowledge the payment requirements, cancellation fees, refund rules, and any specific hotel or airport transfer conditions disclosed for their booking.
9. Applicable Law
These Terms & Conditions are subject to applicable law in Ghana and any other mandatory legal requirements applicable to the booking. Nothing in these terms excludes rights that cannot legally be waived.
